    title: "38% IIT Faculty Posts Are Vacant in 2026 — How It Affects Your Child's Education",
    description: "IITs face 38% faculty shortage in 2026. Over 4,000 professor positions vacant across 23 IITs. Impact on education quality and government recruitment drive.",
    date: "13 अगस्त 2026, सुबह 10 बजकर 20 मिनट",
    modifiedDate: "August 13, 2026",
    author: "Rifaul Hasan",
    authorName: "Rifaul Hasan",
    authorSlug: "rifaul-hasan",
    authorRole: "Principal & Academic Expert, JGPS",
