    title: "JNVST 2027: NTA's New AI Security Will Disqualify Thousands — Are You Ready?",
    description: "NTA introduces AI security measures for JNVST 2027 and other entrance exams. Anti-cheating technology, biometric verification, and encrypted question papers.",
    date: "13 अगस्त 2026, दोपहर 12 बजकर 15 मिनट",
    modifiedDate: "August 13, 2026",
    author: "Amit Kumar",
    authorName: "Amit Kumar",
    authorSlug: "amit-kumar",
