    description: "Child failed entrance exam — what to do? 5 practical options for parents when their child doesn't clear JNVST, AISSEE, or other entrance exams.",
    date: "13 अगस्त 2026, दोपहर 5 बजकर 15 मिनट",
    modifiedDate: "August 13, 2026",
